# Canvas-aware image providers

When adding or changing an `IMAGE_PROVIDER` under `backend/app/services/providers/`:

1. If the provider cannot use `image_data` for `type=edit`, refuse with a clear error. Do not return text-to-image as if it edited the canvas.
2. Register the provider in `providers/__init__.py` and document it in `.env.example`.
3. Keep secrets in `.env` only. Never commit API keys.
4. Prefer the existing helper pair `decode_optional_image` / `image_to_base64_png` from `base.py`.
